  "word_count": 935,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n# Cost & Compare\n\n\n\n# Dental Implant Affordability - Los Angeles, CA\n\n\n\n## Get Dental Work Done Today with Our Financial Options\n\n\n\n## Transform Your Entire Mouth\n\n\nHow long has it been since you smiled? Are you self-conscious when you eat? Do you have many failing or missing teeth? If so, this can have a lot of potential effects on your physical and mental health. Thankfully, you have options when it comes to replacing your teeth. We can put an end to your oral pain and help you live your best life! From dentures to All-on-4® dental implants in Los Angeles, CA, West LA Implants has a suite of full mouth dental replacements that can transform your smile and your life.\n\nGet Pricing\n\n\n## Your Tooth Replacement Options\n\n\nAt West LA Implants, Dr. Tony Barriere offers a variety of solutions to missing or failing teeth: dentures, implant supported dentures and All-on-4 dental implants. When you need to replace all of your teeth, it’s critical to know what your options are, and we want you to make an informed decision.\n\nWhile they are the most affordable option initially, dentures aren’t a long-lasting solution to tooth loss. In many cases, they may end up causing problems such as jawbone recession or friction sores. Additionally, they require adhesive and special cleaners, and the expense and hassle of these can add up quickly.\n\nImplant supported dentures are the next step up when replacing a full mouth of teeth. These fully removable dentures snap onto fixtures that are surgically implanted into your mouth. Due to these implants, they tend to stay on longer than traditional dentures, and they can also reduce jawbone loss. They even cost less than full mouth dental implants!\n\nFinally, seen as the “gold standard” for full mouth dental replacement, All-on-4 dental implants are zirconium replacement teeth attached to four or more posts that are surgically implanted into your jaw. They restore nearly all of your biting and chewing power, and you take care of them the way you would take care of your original teeth.\n\n\n#### Traditional Dentures\n\n\nLowest initial cost\n\nFragile\n\nMust be removed at night\n\nRestores approximately 25% of biting power\n\nRequires adhesive agents such as glue\n\n\n#### Implant Supported Dentures\n\n\nMedium initial cost\n\nReduces jawbone recession\n\nFully removable\n\nFewer food restrictions\n\nMore biting and chewing power\n\n\n#### Full Arch Fixed Teeth\n\n\nHighest initial cost\n\nFully customized to your mouth\n\nPermanently Fixed\n\n99% restored biting and chewing power\n\nA lifelong solution to tooth loss\n\n\n## Why Choose West LA Implants?\n\n\nWhen it comes to getting dental implants and dentures, you have a lot of options, especially in a city like Los Angeles. Our team believes that West LA Implants should be your first stop when looking for a full mouth replacement of any kind! Our approach provides the highest value for your payment, no matter which solution you choose.\n\nWe offer the newest, highest-end technology in our Los Angeles office, and Dr. Barriere is committed to continuing his education. That’s why he completed more than 300 hours of continuing education in 2021, on his mission to never stop learning.\n\nWest LA Implants also offers a one-year warranty on all dental implants: If a material fails within the first year after your implant, we’ll cover it 100% with no questions asked. We even offer free second opinions on all procedures!\n\n\n## Making Your Perfect Smile Affordable\n\n\nWhether you opt for full mouth dental implants or dentures, tooth replacement is one of the best things you can do for your smile and your ongoing health. However, we recognize that cost is often a barrier for our patients, especially when selecting All-on-4 dental implants. That’s why West LA Implants offers a variety of ways to make your perfect smile affordable, from providing in-house financing to partnering with a variety of dental insurance and third-party financing companies, we strive to make your ideal smile a real possibility for you.\n\n\n## Our Patients tell the story best\n\n\n\n##### \"Full Arch All-On-4 Gave Me My Confidence Back!\"\n\n\n\n##### Leslie - Full Arch All-On-4\n\n\n\n##### \"I Felt Like The Old Me Because Of My Crowns & Dental Implants\"\n\n\n\n##### Emily - Crowns & Dental Implants\n\n\n\n##### \"I Have Teeth Again Thanks To My Full Mouth Reconstruction!\"\n\n\n\n##### Michael - Full Mouth Reconstruction\n\n\n\n## Schedule An Appointment\n\n\nDesired Consult Date\n\nPreferred Method of Communication\n\nText\n\nPhone\n\nEmail\n\nSend\n\nI understand the information disclosed in this form may be subject to re-disclosure and may no longer be protected by HIPAA privacy regulations and the HITECH Act.\n\n\n### Find out if you're a\n\n\n\n## candidate for dental implants\n\n\n\n#### Answer the Following Questions To Learn more about our pricing and financing options.\n\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
